  "content": [
    {
      "text": "To him that is afflicted pity should be shewed, Job 6:14. as a father pitieth his children, so the Lord pitieth them that fear him, Ps. 103:13. He that hath pity upon the poor lendeth unto the Lord, Prov. 19:17. shall have no pity on the fruit of the womb, Isa. 13:18 (2 Ne. 23:18). in his love and in his pity he redeemed them, Isa. 63:9. I had pity for mine holy name, Ezek. 36:21. Then will the Lord … pity his people, Joel 2:18. I will no more pity the inhabitants of the land, Zech. 11:6.",
